etitive taggers alike.\n\nWhether you're navigating chaotic obstacle-filled maps, chilling in cozy hangout zones, or showing off your wildest cosmetics, Soft Coconut is your digital jungle gym. With tons of personality, fun hats, a growing collection of game modes, and uniquely crafted maps, the experience is constantly evolving.", "short_description": "Swing, climb, and tag your way through vibrant pixel-style maps in Soft Coconut! Customize your character, explore unique environments, and hang out with friends in this physics-based VR game. With cosmetic rooms, social hubs, and chaotic tree-filled arenas, there's always something to do \u2014 whether you're a chilled monkey or a hyper tagger!\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "VR Source entertainment", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blue-policy/start", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "bluestudio125@gmail.com", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dvrsourceentertainment.carrd.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9348978355229855"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "680439518005291"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "680439518005291"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1744032840, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "680439